---
import DocLayout from '@/layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/consts';
const updated = new Date('2026-10-08');
---

<DocLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Heva Wellness collects, uses and protects your personal data, including cookies, Google AdSense advertising, analytics and your rights under UK and EU GDPR."
  updated={updated}
>
  {/* This template covers what Google AdSense requires. Have it reviewed by a qualified adviser for your business and jurisdictions before launch. */}

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} Ltd (“Heva”, “we”, “us”) runs this website. We are the data controller for personal data collected
    through it. Contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or {SITE.address.street},
    {SITE.address.city} {SITE.address.postcode}.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> your name, email and message when you use the contact form or subscribe to our newsletter.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> pages visited, device and browser type, approximate location and referring site, collected through cookies and similar technologies if you consent.</li>
    <li><strong>Health information:</strong> we do not collect health information through this website. Clinical information for members is handled separately under our patient privacy notice.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiries (legal basis: legitimate interests, or steps before a contract).</li>
    <li>To send our newsletter if you subscribe (legal basis: consent, which you can withdraw at any time).</li>
    <li>To understand how the site is used and improve it (legal basis: consent).</li>
    <li>To show advertising that helps fund our free articles (legal basis: consent where required).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Advertising and Google AdSense</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google AdSense to show ads on some pages. Google and its partners are third-party vendors that use cookies
    to serve ads based on your previous visits to this website and other websites.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the internet.</li>
    <li>You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
    <li>You can also opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies for personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a> or, in Europe, <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">youronlinechoices.eu</a>.</li>
    <li>Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Visitors in the UK, European Economic Area and Switzerland are asked for consent before any advertising or
    analytics cookies are set. If you decline, you may still see non-personalised ads.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    With your consent we use Google Analytics to count visits and see which articles are useful. IP addresses are not
    stored by Google Analytics 4. You can opt out with the
    <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a> for the full list. You can change your choice at any time with the “Cookie settings” link in the footer.</p>

  <h2>Sharing your data</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal data. We share it only with service providers who help us run the site (hosting,
    email, form handling, analytics and advertising), under contracts that protect it. Some providers are outside the
    UK/EEA; where that happens we rely on adequacy decisions or standard contractual clauses.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Contact messages are kept for up to 24 months. Newsletter data is kept until you unsubscribe. Analytics data is kept for 14 months.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to access, correct, delete or move your data, to restrict or object to how we use it, and to withdraw
    consent. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. You can also complain to the
    <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Information Commissioner’s Office</a> or your local data protection authority.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 16.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We’ll update this page if our practices change, and show the date of the latest version at the top.</p>
</DocLayout>
